<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at</p>
<p>the close of play on the third day of the second test between</p>
<p>West</p>
<p>Indies and India at the Queen's Park Oval on Sunday:</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 296 (R.Holder 91; A.Kumble 5-104)</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 171-1)</p>
<p> V.V.Laxman lbw Ambrose		     0</p>
<p> N.Sidhu not out			    196</p>
<p> R.Dravid b Ambrose			  57</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar run out			 88</p>
<p> S.Ganguly not out			    3</p>
<p> Extras (b-6, lb-9, nb-8)		  23</p>
<p> Total (three wickets)		    367</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-0 2-171 3-345</p>
<p>To bat: M.Azharuddin, N.Mongia, A.Kumble, S.Joshi,</p>
<p>A.Kuruvilla, V.Prasad.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Ambrose 32-7-71-2 (nb1), Walsh 31-10-60-0</p>
<p>(nb2), Rose 30-6-79-0 (nb4), Dillon 27-6-73-0 (nb1), Hooper</p>
<p>26-7-49-0, Chanderpaul 8-1-20-0.</p>
